  "description": "The same consultants, institutes and phrases — 'the science isn't settled,' 'more research is needed' — are traced from tobacco defence through climate denial to flame retardants. It names the playbook for manufacturing uncertainty as a professional service. Once the technique is visible across decades, it becomes recognisable in any contested field.\n\nA documentary that looks at pundits-for-hire who present themselves as scientific authorities as they speak about topics like toxic chemicals, pharmaceuticals and climate change.",
